{"id":"458212","name":"水蒸蛋","author":"水心妞","authorId":"2177672","desc":"","cover":"images/458212/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"一勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋二个。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/13/2019051315577306737862177672.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"打入碗中，加少许盐，搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/13/2019051315577306954532177672.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀后加入适量水，1:1.5的水，用蛋壳量水方便快捷。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/13/2019051315577306951292177672.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入盘子中，盖上保鲜膜。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/13/2019051315577306976302177672.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"水烧开后，把盘子放入锅中，大火蒸三到五分钟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/13/2019051315577306986352177672.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"出锅，淋上生抽和香油，美味又营养。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/13/2019051315577307004212177672.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}